title: Install HyperGSD on Node.js
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

If you host your ~TiddlyWiki through Node.js, you may install ~HyperGSD through the [[standard drag-and-drop method|Add HyperGSD to an existing wiki]], or by extracting it to [[plugin folders|https://tiddlywiki.com/#PluginFolders]] as follows:

# Download the [[source code to HyperGSD|https://github.com/superuser-does/hypergsd]]
# Extract the sub-folder of each plugin you want from `plugins/` to your ~TiddlyWiki's `/plugins/` folder //(i.e. a `plugins/` folder under the root folder that ~TiddlyWiki server starts from)//<br /><small>Note that the main plugin of `plugins/hypergsd/` is required for all other plugins listed.</small>
# Restart the server

To avoid side effects, this method should not be combined with any other install/update method.
Installing the plugin(s) through drag-and-drop or the [[plugin library|HyperGSD plugin library]] will add it in as shadow tiddlers in your `tiddlers/` directory.
As such, you will need to repeat this process each time you want to update to a newer version.